ber materials.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"The energy resolution for 100 GeV electrons must be 4.5% or better.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Simulated 100 GeV electron energy resolution for Absorber-F3 at 5.0 mm was 3.126% in the best dedicated run and about 3.1-3.3% across repeated/summarized 5 mm evaluations, below the 4.5% limit.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"The residual dose rate at 1 m after one week of cooldown must not exceed 20 uSv/h.\",\n      \"status\": \"unknown\",\n      \"evidence\": \"No available project document provided residual-dose or activation values for F1/F2/F3, and the simulation tool reports only energy resolution.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Plate thickness between 2 and 10 mm.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Recommended plate thickness is 5.0 mm, which is within the allowed 2-10 mm interval.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"requirement\": \"Finish by submitting one recommended material and plate thickness.\",\n      \"status\": \"met\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Submitted one recommendation: Absorber-F3 with 5.0 mm plates.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}", "call_id": "call_ba25832253494b808870505c933ede91", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0cf55e1227bdec41006b02b74d5c2887d0860f2d7b2d0f3edc", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
